#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:804 ../../../CHANGELOG.md:820
msgid "Changed"
msgstr "变更"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:12
msgid "Keep up to three lines from each completed Bash output stream in the transcript, with `Ctrl-O` offering a larger 24-line preview for recent commands."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:13
msgid "Replace wildcard imports between minacode modules with explicit imports, and have Ruff reject any future `import *` usage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:14
msgid "Make `/status` context and prompt-cache usage immediately readable with compact progress bars, token counts, and percentages, while retaining its Rich table and hiding empty detail."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:15
msgid "Lower the default provider request timeout from 180 seconds to 120 seconds; explicitly configured values are unchanged."
msgstr "将 provider 请求的默认超时从 180 秒降至 120 秒；显式配置的值不受影响。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:16
msgid "Increase transient model retries from two to five, and show attempts with concise reasons in the running TUI, such as `retrying 2/6 · timeout`, then keep `attempt 2/6` visible while the replacement request continues."
msgstr "将模型瞬时错误重试次数从两次增加到五次，并在运行中的 TUI 里显示简短原因，例如 `retrying 2/6 · timeout`；替代请求继续时保留 `attempt 2/6`。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:17
msgid "Resolve explicit settings and necessary provider compatibility overrides once into a typed request policy, keeping the default OpenAI-compatible path generic and protocol request builders independent from host-profile storage. Domain overrides match real subdomains, and OpenCode routing uses broad Claude, Qwen, and GPT families because its single base URL multiplexes different wire protocols by model."
msgstr "将显式设置和必要的 provider 兼容覆盖一次性解析为类型化请求策略，使默认 OpenAI-compatible 路径保持通用，并让协议请求构造与 host profile 存储相互独立。Domain 覆盖只匹配真实子域名；由于 OpenCode 的单一 base URL 会按模型复用不同 wire protocol，其路由使用宽泛的 Claude、Qwen 和 GPT family。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:18
msgid "Detect OpenAI reasoning through the `o` and `gpt-5` model families instead of enumerating releases. Aliyun endpoints under `aliyuncs.com` use `reasoning_effort` only for the documented Qwen3.8 family, including `none` for `/reason off`, so existing `chat_reasoning = \"auto\"` configurations work without per-model overrides."
msgstr "通过 `o` 和 `gpt-5` model family 识别 OpenAI reasoning，不枚举具体版本。`aliyuncs.com` 下的阿里云 endpoint 只对有文档依据的 Qwen3.8 family 使用 `reasoning_effort`，其中 `/reason off` 使用 `none`，因此现有 `chat_reasoning = \"auto\"` 配置无需逐模型覆盖。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:19
msgid "Stop imposing the obsolete 32K output cap on DeepSeek; current models use the server-side default unless `provider.max_tokens` is explicitly configured."
msgstr "不再对 DeepSeek 强加已过时的 32K 输出上限；除非显式设置 `provider.max_tokens`，当前模型使用 server 端默认值。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:20
msgid "Raise the normalized `minimal` manual-thinking budget to the provider-supported 1,024-token floor instead of sending an invalid 256-token Anthropic budget."
msgstr "将统一的 `minimal` manual-thinking budget 提高到 provider 支持的 1,024 token 下限，不再发送无效的 256 token Anthropic budget。"

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:21
msgid "Add documented compatibility overrides for Kimi and Z.AI across their international and China endpoints. Kimi Code remains distinct from the open platform; both Z.AI regions share GLM-5.2+ `reasoning_effort`, Kimi keeps its documented `prompt_cache_key`, and Z.AI relies on automatic context caching."
msgstr "为 Kimi 和 Z.AI 的国际版与中国版 endpoint 添加有文档依据的兼容覆盖。Kimi Code 与开放平台保持独立；Z.AI 两个区域共享 GLM-5.2+ `reasoning_effort`，Kimi 保留有文档支持的 `prompt_cache_key`，Z.AI 使用自动 context cache。"

