#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:248
msgid "Syntax-highlight inline Edit diff previews with Pygments. Added and context lines (the \"new\" file version) are lexed together as one code block so multiline strings and indentation-sensitive languages highlight correctly; removed lines stay plain diff-red. Degrades gracefully to plain diff coloring when Pygments is unavailable, the file extension is unknown, or the lexer fails."
