#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:249
msgid "Add background jobs via a `Job` tool (`start`/`status`/`wait`/`list`/`kill`). Long-running or non-blocking work — dev servers, watchers, long builds and test suites — runs in its own process group without blocking the agent; output is buffered (capped per stream), drained non-blockingly on `status`, and returned as a tail. Concurrency is capped (`MAX_JOBS`), running jobs surface in the status bar (`jobs N`), the `/status` row, and a new read-only `/ps` command; `kill` sends SIGTERM then SIGKILL to the group. Jobs run until they exit or are killed (no foreground `shell_timeout` cap), and `Job(action=\"wait\")` with no/zero timeout blocks until the process exits."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:253
msgid "Rename the interactive `Question` tool to `Ask`; the old `Question` tool name is no longer registered."
