#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:254
msgid "Replace the status-bar `+N` queued-message counter with a live queue region. While the agent works, messages you type sit below the +> input under a dim \"── queued\" divider with a left→right sweep animation, instead of being echoed into the scrollback log; when the turn flushes them they move up into the log as `+ <text>` lines and the region shrinks (the divider disappears once nothing is queued)."
