#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:255
msgid "Cache the Anthropic request's stable `tools`+`system` prefix with a `cache_control` breakpoint on the system block, so each turn no longer reprocesses the system prompt and tool schemas from scratch (Anthropic prompt caching only activates at an explicit breakpoint)."
msgstr ""

