#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:261
msgid "Git branch is no longer shown in the environment context sent to the model."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:262
msgid "Removed branch-change detection protection that prevented `git commit` after an external branch switch."
