#~ msgid "Add `/diff`, a read-only viewer for edits made by minacode. It shows the latest user round and the overall net session diff in `Latest` and `Session` tabs, supports keyboard navigation and paging, and persists edit snapshots across `--resume`."
#~ msgstr ""

#~ msgid "Raise `TurnDiff.SNAPSHOT_CHAR_LIMIT` from 200KB to 1MB so typical large source files (including minacode.py itself) keep their before/after snapshots and render as one clean unified diff instead of the concatenated per-Edit fallback."
#~ msgstr ""

